[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3951938299","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116680#issuecomment-3951938299","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116680","id":3951938299,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7rjcr7","user":{"login":"dalexeev","id":47700418,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NzAwNDE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47700418?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev","html_url":"https://github.com/dalexeev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-24T13:38:52Z","updated_at":"2026-02-24T14:06:51Z","body":"Perhaps we could put this in `Variant::{set,get}_named()`? Then the overhead would only be incurred for checking non-existent properties. I don't think changes to the VM (`OPCODE_{SET,GET}_NAMED`) are needed on the GDScript side. Only in the analyzer and maybe additionally in the compiler/codegen to optimize the typed context.\r\n\r\nBut the main question isn't the implementation, but rather the necessity of this feature in the language (and in the GDExtension interface?). The linked proposal was highly upvoted, and this PR is also quickly gaining thumbs up. But in my opinion, we lack practical examples that would confirm that this feature actually solves broad problems in real projects, and isn't just a \"nice to have\" feature or required only in certain niche cases. In the shader language, this is justified, and we don't have to deal with the problems of gradual typing.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3951938299/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3966302643","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116680#issuecomment-3966302643","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116680","id":3966302643,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7saPmz","user":{"login":"Chaosus","id":3036176,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMzYxNzY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3036176?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosus","html_url":"https://github.com/Chaosus","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosus/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosus/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosus/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosus/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosus/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosus/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-26T12:27:47Z","updated_at":"2026-02-26T12:27:47Z","body":"Ah, never mind, I thought it was a good idea but now I see that it is bad.. for performance at least.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments